# LF everywhere, whatever core.autocrlf says. Git for Windows defaults to
# CRLF on checkout, and tools/package_workshop.py checks mod.info for
# "id=Sewars\n": a CRLF clone would fail to package. The game reads LF fine.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.pack binary
*.tiles binary
*.npz binary
*.pyc binary
